window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It takes a special kind of Omega to bring an Alpha to his knees.</p> <p>Kind.</p> <p>Sweet. <br> Beautiful. With legs that go on forever, colored eyes, perky protruding nose, funny ears, and...Where was I? Ah yes, I collected one such Omega, and I’m bringing her before my king.</p> <p>I am Tayseer, the Collector, the Legend.</p> <p>And I will deliver my people the queen.</p>"; 
